# CNAME File for Custom Domain
#
# If you want to use a custom domain (e.g., www.abhishekkarna.com):
# 1. Rename this file from "CNAME.example" to "CNAME" (no file extension)
# 2. Replace the text below with your custom domain
# 3. Configure your domain's DNS settings to point to GitHub Pages
#
# Instructions: https://docs.github.com/en/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site

# Uncomment and replace with your domain:
# www.yourdomain.com
